# .dockerignore — trim the build context for deploy/docker/Dockerfile.*.
#
# The release build needs Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock, crates/, tests/ (workspace members),
# migrations/ (sqlx::migrate! embeds migrations/control at compile time) and .sqlx/ (the offline
# query cache). Everything below is excluded so the context stays small and layer-cacheable — most
# importantly target/, which is many gigabytes of build artifacts.
target/
**/target/
.git/
.gitignore
.github/
.claude/
docs/
*.md

# Release images do not compile integration/e2e targets. Keep every workspace member's Cargo.toml
# and src/ tree so Cargo metadata remains valid, but omit auto-discovered test targets. Otherwise
# merely adding an e2e test changes cargo-chef's recipe and cold-rebuilds bundled DuckDB (~18 min).
crates/*/tests/
tests/e2e/tests/
